  "ai_overview": {
    "text_blocks": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "Losartan is a prescription medication (commonly known as Cozaar) used to treat high blood pressure, protect the kidneys in type 2 diabetes, and lower stroke risk.",
        "reference_indexes": [
          0,
          1
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Common Side Effects"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Dizziness or lightheadedness (especially when standing up quickly, as blood pressure drops)"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Fatigue, weakness, or tiredness"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Upper respiratory tract infections or stuffy/congested nose"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Back pain, joint pain, or muscle cramps"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Low blood sugar (hypoglycemia)"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Diarrhea or mild stomach upset"
          }
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          1,
          2,
          3,
          4,
          5,
          6,
          7
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Serious Side Effects & Risks"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "High potassium levels (hyperkalemia): Can cause irregular heartbeats, weakness, or nausea. Avoid extra potassium supplements or salt substitutes unless told to use them by a doctor .",
            "reference_indexes": [
              1,
              2,
              5
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Low blood pressure (hypotension): Can lead to fainting or severe lightheadedness.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              0,
              2,
              9
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Kidney problems: Can worsen kidney function or decrease urine output in sensitive individuals.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              1,
              9
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Severe allergic reactions (angioedema): Can cause swelling of the face, lips, tongue, or throat, or trouble breathing. Seek emergency care immediately if this happens.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              5,
              9
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Pregnancy warning (Black Box Warning): Losartan can cause serious harm or death to an unborn baby during the second and third trimesters. Discontinue use immediately if pregnancy is detected."
          }
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          0,
          1,
          8
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "If you are experiencing specific side effects, let me know:"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "How long you have been taking losartan"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "What symptoms are bothering you"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "I can help you understand whether it is a normal adjustment phase or something to discuss with your doctor."
      }
